Slate for Windows (this repository)

A Windows desktop build and installer for Slate — derivative work of
Slate v0.3.2 under Apache-2.0.

- App host: Go + Wails (instead of Electron) for a native Windows binary
- Installer: per-user Setup that audits dependencies, installs/updates the
  app, and optionally helps install Claude Code for the AI brain

Windows packaging, installer, and host port are not official Wasserman
releases. Credit for Slate belongs with Sam Wasserman.

Attribution required in About / credits surfaces and this NOTICE.
